<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces are expanding border patrols and firing warning shots after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting the Thai foreign minister to contact Myanmar officials about the fighting that injured Thai nationals. A 15‑year-old Thai golfer was killed and a caddy injured by lightning at a tournament in Chachoengsao. The Thai minister publicly challenged China’s travel-scam alert targeting Thailand. Residents near the Cambodian border checkpoint remain unable to return to their homes, and cross-border QR payment services are being rolled out in Bangkok. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQSm91elhaaVZ6Xy1zUW5OZTlmTTZ1MVgxUjhJeXNIMU1OMDl2U1F0RTlxcnpJeUpRVUdPTElsOWhoU0prNFRMYzRzcVFHQmRvUkpRVTU1cWNpZ2FTeUltbEJWUHpoMWh3YzlRVDhyaUJESEFUeGN0ejBwWDhnWmxTM1o1azdCanFHUFk1UjAybTJ3UHhONXdTc2dDTGNBZmJBZFVWd2FFZmhkdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE9jb1pvbno3RzJndGFzUl84ejZVSDhYTE1xRlhRM0Nwa2xfOWFIejJ2d3MxWDMwSFFfVWN1cEtCQy13X3pGYnppU1lWN2o3MTdvWmpKY3ZCc3dpY1VDX0NzNNIBXEFVX3lxTE4ydERTUE1JUnc1MERLb1dsVm9ZQUlTdUtRZEFWWEs1OFAwang0ZXJTSG1FdnI2OW9BVFE0TVdkQTYydzU0cGJubUpGS3JDQ2w4NEEyZGVKa1FBWnBW?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE5sMmlYOFdUVkVzSmVVaGh2WERCMzhrM05BakZTV1lvbmR0akM0WDJTcDg4dHlYQ3Fmam5BX3Fpb3FOS2FLaW9TVGtoMWVvWnlRclE?oc=5&quot;&gt;គណបក្សប្រជាជនកម្ពុជា&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOUnhVZHRGTDVZaS15UG9lOXhvUWtYV09GOGVjb0VTR0RKM2JFVjdtdUJWTlFvbGxWVXVuOFF1VjBWdkRxX05VT0JEMEIxV3ZqNW4xYW5Yenc5cG40YTVfTVp3akR6VzZG